@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/external_bridge_instances/{instance_uuid}/actions/resume/invoke
actor "The client ." as C
participant "REST / RestAlchemy\nThe controller ." as API
database "PostgreSQL\ncanonical lines/read lines" as DB
queue "Immutable outbox event\n+ delivery_snapshot_event 1:1" as O
participant "Worker / manager\nThe provider 's processor" as W

C -> API: The request POST + bearer-The token IAM
activate API
API -> DB: block/check the canonical area
API -> DB: Fix the change in status
API -> O: event -> delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
DB --> API: The state of the system .
O --> API: the recording is fixed
API --> C: Sanitized photo . 200
deactivate API
W -> O: claim exact scope; lease/fencing/retry/DLQ
W -> DB: I 'm going to update the projection or control
DB --> W: The fixed materialized condition
note right of W
  If the job involves placement Messenger:
  One slot is monopoly owned (project_id, topic_uuid)
  and processing MESSAGE.created_at DESC.
  Provider management keeps its own stable order.
end note

note over API,DB
  Public links UUID are scalar UUID-The properties.
  Physical columns *_uuid remain indexed FK.
end note
@enduml
